374-## 14. Phase ownership
375-
376-### PLAN
377-
378:The scope-plan reviewer owns requirement-to-checklist mapping. It consumes the candidate set, reads candidates, title-triages the remaining corpus, records gaps/orphan-suspects/open questions, and writes `scope_check_save`.
379-
380-### REVIEW
381-
382:- Behavior reviewer consumes current diff, checklist commitments, scope-check result, and relevant candidates.
383:- Docs reviewer owns doc-code promise drift and may reuse the same candidate digest.
384:- Coverage reviewer checks that candidate routing and read evidence cover verification intent.
385-- Review lanes cannot mutate Story phase or owner artifacts.
386-
387-### TEST
388-
389:Validation checks artifact freshness, schema, budgets, read-log reconciliation, and required routing metrics. It does not invent candidates.
390-
391-### Delivery
392-
393:Delivery reviewer consumes the signed scope result, current diff, actual transcripts, and candidate/read evidence. It may request rerouting when doc promises or corpus changes make the candidate set stale.
