396-
397:Implementation that makes candidate artifacts or read evidence gate-consumed MUST update:
398-
399-- process fact registry and contract verification;
400-- command policies and legal writer lanes;
401-- artifact schema/version validation;
--
410-- Hosts propose terms before receiving document bodies.
411-- Document instructions cannot alter tool permissions, budgets, lifecycle phase, or output schema.
412-- Paths are repository-relative, normalized, traversal-safe, and constrained to the configured requirements directory.
413-- Symlinks escaping the repository are rejected.
414:- Search output is size-capped before entering host context.
415:- The shared pre-egress sanitizer covers every host-bound Story field, seed, path/title, provenance record, search snippet, and proposal artifact; secret-like strings never become host input or persisted keyword proposals.
416:- Host adapters cannot bypass sanitization. If classification is uncertain, the host is skipped and deterministic local routing continues.
417-- Proposal and search artifacts record provider, prompt digest, and schema version.
