603-- Candidate and read artifacts are hash-bound and freshness-checked.
604-- Full scan requires a structured escalation reason and remains tool-driven.
605-- Critical/high-risk golden recall is 100%.
606-- Finding-equivalence baseline shows no lost load-bearing finding.
